      "message": "Yes, if you\u0027re moving this to native code then we\u0027re all better off, and you don\u0027t need any of my code suggestions. 👍",
      "parentUuid": "23adef5d_c2584688",
      "revId": "2b30583f9aaf9795612db23d6d36056d85ae2c4e",
